#!/bin/sh
# Answers mDNS queries for <hostname>.local (tools/mdnsd.c, server=usbip), so
# PCs find the Pi on any network; init restarts it if it exits. VirtualHere
# does its own Bonjour on the same port.

[ "$(cat /run/server 2>/dev/null)" = usbip ] || exec sleep 2147483647

. /etc/functions

# Restarted by init after exiting: pause so a crash loop doesn't spin.
[ -e /run/mdnsd.started ] && sleep 1
: > /run/mdnsd.started

iface=$(netif)
while [ -z "$iface" ]; do
	sleep 1
	iface=$(netif)
done
exec /usr/sbin/mdnsd "$iface" 2> /dev/kmsg
